    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Zhentarim<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Vast<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 2<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Research</p><p>The Zhentarim keep stations for safe, swift long-distance travel. Yours has temporary stabling for four Large creatures (two Medium creatures take the space of one Large creature), looked after by the hirelings.</p><p><strong>Long-Distance Travel Speed.</strong> Finishing a Long Rest in your Bastion prepares you for travel: your group's maximum travel pace increases by one step (Slow to Normal, or Normal to Fast).</p><p><strong>Research: Reconnaissance.</strong> The hirelings spend 7 days gathering information for an upcoming journey. For its duration, you have Advantage on Wisdom (Survival) checks to forage or navigate.</p><p><em>Source: Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn.</em></p>",
